{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215140","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621514001:0":{"text":"乌鸦兄，不如歇歇嗓子吧？再唱下去，麦田里的稻穗都枯了。","source_cn":"乌鸦兄，不如歇歇嗓子吧？再唱下去，麦田里的稻穗都枯了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x286FFB66E8DA8E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621514002:0":{"text":"<hpy>黑眼睛，黑羽毛，黑黑的披风真漂亮~</hpy>","source_cn":"<hpy>黑眼睛，黑羽毛，黑黑的披风真漂亮~</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E57BE64CEDBB55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621514003:0":{"text":"又装作没听到吗？这只扰民的鸟，破喉咙比生锈的铃铛还难听。","source_cn":"又装作没听到吗？这只扰民的鸟，破喉咙比生锈的铃铛还难听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x634F62BC7E82E24F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621514004:0":{"text":"两位，现在不是悠闲的时候，喵丽丝正在策划颠覆莱希拉姆的秩序！","source_cn":"两位，现在不是悠闲的时候，喵丽丝正在策划颠覆莱希拉姆的秩序！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58C2F2ED28EEC57C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621514005:0":{"text":"你是……？","source_cn":"你是……？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE58A64A13DABD563","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621514006:0":{"text":"我是汪达尔，正在组建一个对抗喵丽丝的小队。","source_cn":"我是汪达尔，正在组建一个对抗喵丽丝的小队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A33972784AADCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621514007:0":{"text":"嘎哈哈！你们怕是对喵丽丝大人有什么误会吧？她可是未来的希望！","source_cn":"嘎哈哈！你们怕是对喵丽丝大人有什么误会吧？她可是未来的希望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A2989B742538C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621514008:0":{"text":"我还给她写了新歌呢，要不要来段听听？","source_cn":"我还给她写了新歌呢，要不要来段听听？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD79D16A482E6EDB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621514009:0":{"text":"别！你的歌我真听够了。","source_cn":"别！你的歌我真听够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x549A5E9EE18178F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621514010:0":{"text":"怎么？嫉妒我唱得好？","source_cn":"怎么？嫉妒我唱得好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EE0677969D963CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621514011:0":{"text":"两个动物你一句我一句地拌起嘴来，汪达尔想插话却总被打断，只能无奈地看向你。","source_cn":"两个动物你一句我一句地拌起嘴来，汪达尔想插话却总被打断...","status":"matched_r